# The compiler emits LF unconditionally, and `tests/golden_textmap.rs`
# compares its output to these fixtures byte-for-byte. A CRLF checkout on
# Windows fails that comparison — which is exactly what happened on this
# repository's first CI run, on three tests at once.
*.textmap -text
*.json    -text

# WADs are binary. `tests/first_map.rs` compares the committed artifact to
# freshly compiled bytes, so any newline translation would corrupt it.
*.wad binary
